{
  "name": "Intraocular Pressure",
  "remarks": [
    "Submodule for IOP procedure and findings with expanded medications, glaucoma diagnosis, and follow-up care.",
    "",
    "IOP is attribute-driven and persistent across visits (`iop_reading`). The Observation state class",
    "has no `assign_to_attribute` field -- only `attribute` -- so a JSON module that sets",
    "`assign_to_attribute` on an Observation is silently ignored by the engine; the value must instead",
    "be drawn by a SetAttribute state and read back into the Observation via its real `attribute` field.",
    "A population baseline is drawn once per patient (Draw_Baseline_IOP). On every later visit the",
    "reading is redrawn within a narrow band keyed off treatment status and the patient's original",
    "baseline tier (Elevated_IOP_Jitter / Normal_IOP_Jitter / Treated_IOP_Jitter), instead of a fresh",
    "independent 8-35 mmHg roll every visit. The previous per-visit design OR-combined two independent",
    "8-35 draws (P(either eye > 21) = 1-(1-14/27)^2 = 0.77), flagging ~77% of visits as elevated and",
    "making nearly every recurring patient (e.g. every T2 diabetic routed through this submodule)",
    "glaucomatous over time. Both eyes' Observations read the same persisted value; per-eye divergence",
    "was not modelled, keeping the attribute contract to a single shared `iop_reading`.",
    "",
    "Diagnosis (Glaucoma_Diagnosis / Ocular_Hypertension_Diagnosis) and medication ordering are each",
    "attribute-guarded so a patient already carrying the diagnosis, or already on a drop, is not",
    "re-diagnosed or re-ordered on every subsequent visit. Glaucoma drops are chronic:true, matching",
    "real-world indefinite once-daily/twice-daily dosing rather than a one-time fill.",
    "",
    "Two RxNorm codes were wrong and have been replaced with RxNav-verified SCDs (Semantic Clinical",
    "Drugs; the previous codes were an SCDC and a bare ingredient, neither a dispensable drug):",
    " - brimonidine: RxCUI 1999015 (previously used here) is an SCDC, \"brimonidine tartrate 0.25",
    "   MG/ML\" -- an ingredient+strength component with no dose form, and its strength did not even",
    "   match this state's own display text. Replaced with RxCUI 861204, the SCD \"brimonidine tartrate",
    "   1 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution\" (verified via RxNav rxcui/861204/historystatus). This is also the",
    "   exact code eye/ophthalmic_progression.json's treatment-detection check looks for, so ordering it",
    "   here now closes that IOP feedback loop instead of the two modules silently disagreeing.",
    " - timolol: RxCUI 10600 was an IN (ingredient-only \"timolol\", no strength or dose form).",
    "   Replaced with RxCUI 2702393, the SCD \"timolol hemihydrate 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution\"",
    "   (verified via RxNav), the closest unqualified (non-preservative-free, non-extended-release)",
    "   generic match to the original display text; RxNorm has no plain \"timolol maleate ... ophthalmic",
    "   solution\" SCD as of this writing."
  ],
  "states": {
    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Test"
    },
    "Terminal": {
      "type": "Terminal"
    },
    "IOP_Test": {
      "type": "Procedure",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "252832004",
          "display": "Intraocular pressure test"
        }
      ],
      "distribution": {
        "kind": "EXACT",
        "parameters": {
          "value": 1
        }
      },
      "unit": "minutes",
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Reading_Gate"
    },
    "IOP_Reading_Gate": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "First visit for this patient (iop_reading unset) draws a fresh population baseline;",
        "every later visit re-enters here and only jitters the existing reading."
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "On_Treatment_Check",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "iop_reading",
            "operator": "is not nil"
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Draw_Baseline_IOP"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Draw_Baseline_IOP": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "distribution": {
        "kind": "UNIFORM",
        "round": true,
        "parameters": {
          "low": 8,
          "high": 35
        }
      },
      "direct_transition": "Classify_Baseline_Tier",
      "remarks": [
        "One-time population baseline IOP. Normal range is roughly 10-21 mmHg; values above 21",
        "establish an elevated baseline tendency (iop_baseline_tier) that persists across future",
        "visits until the patient is treated."
      ]
    },
    "Classify_Baseline_Tier": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "Mark_Elevated_Tier",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "iop_reading",
            "operator": ">",
            "value": 21
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Mark_Normal_Tier"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Mark_Elevated_Tier": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_baseline_tier",
      "value": "elevated",
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Left"
    },
    "Mark_Normal_Tier": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_baseline_tier",
      "value": "normal",
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Left"
    },
    "On_Treatment_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "Treated_IOP_Jitter",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Active Medication",
            "codes": [
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "284008",
                "display": "travoprost 0.04 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "2702393",
                "display": "timolol hemihydrate 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "310015",
                "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "1923432",
                "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML / timolol 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "861204",
                "display": "brimonidine tartrate 1 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "308739",
                "display": "bimatoprost 0.3 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "314072",
                "display": "latanoprost 0.05 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Elevated_IOP_Jitter",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "iop_baseline_tier",
            "operator": "==",
            "value": "elevated"
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Normal_IOP_Jitter"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Treated_IOP_Jitter": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "distribution": {
        "kind": "UNIFORM",
        "round": true,
        "parameters": {
          "low": 12,
          "high": 19
        }
      },
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Left",
      "remarks": [
        "Controlled range on therapy, reflecting the ~25-30% IOP reduction typical of prostaglandin",
        "analog / beta-blocker / CAI monotherapy."
      ]
    },
    "Elevated_IOP_Jitter": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "distribution": {
        "kind": "UNIFORM",
        "round": true,
        "parameters": {
          "low": 22,
          "high": 32
        }
      },
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Left"
    },
    "Normal_IOP_Jitter": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "distribution": {
        "kind": "UNIFORM",
        "round": true,
        "parameters": {
          "low": 10,
          "high": 21
        }
      },
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Left"
    },
    "IOP_Results_Left": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "vital-signs",
      "unit": "mm[Hg]",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "79893-4",
          "display": "Left eye Intraocular pressure"
        },
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "41633001",
          "display": "Intraocular pressure (observable entity)"
        }
      ],
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "direct_transition": "IOP_Results_Right",
      "remarks": [
        "Normal IOP range is 10-21 mmHg, but can be higher in pathological conditions"
      ]
    },
    "IOP_Results_Right": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "vital-signs",
      "unit": "mm[Hg]",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "79892-6",
          "display": "Right eye Intraocular pressure"
        },
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "41633001",
          "display": "Intraocular pressure (observable entity)"
        }
      ],
      "attribute": "iop_reading",
      "direct_transition": "Evaluate_IOP_Levels",
      "remarks": [
        "Normal IOP range is 10-21 mmHg, but can be higher in pathological conditions"
      ]
    },
    "Evaluate_IOP_Levels": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "iop_reading",
            "operator": ">",
            "value": 21
          },
          "transition": "High_IOP_Branch"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Normal_IOP_Follow_Up"
        }
      ]
    },
    "High_IOP_Branch": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "iop_reading",
            "operator": ">",
            "value": 30
          },
          "transition": "Glaucoma_Diagnosis_Gate"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Ocular_Hypertension_Diagnosis_Gate"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Glaucoma_Diagnosis_Gate": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "High_IOP_Medication_Gate",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "glaucoma_diagnosed",
            "operator": "==",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Glaucoma_Diagnosis"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Glaucoma_Diagnosis": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "23986001",
          "display": "Glaucoma (disorder)"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "High_IOP_Medication_Gate",
      "assign_to_attribute": "glaucoma_diagnosed"
    },
    "Ocular_Hypertension_Diagnosis_Gate": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "High_IOP_Medication_Gate",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "ocular_hypertension_diagnosed",
            "operator": "==",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "Ocular_Hypertension_Diagnosis"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Ocular_Hypertension_Diagnosis": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "4210003",
          "display": "Ocular hypertension (disorder)"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "High_IOP_Medication_Gate",
      "assign_to_attribute": "ocular_hypertension_diagnosed"
    },
    "High_IOP_Medication_Gate": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Attribute-guard against re-ordering: a patient already on any glaucoma drop is not given",
        "a duplicate new order every visit -- the existing chronic:true order stands."
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "Terminal",
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Active Medication",
            "codes": [
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "284008",
                "display": "travoprost 0.04 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "2702393",
                "display": "timolol hemihydrate 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "310015",
                "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "1923432",
                "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML / timolol 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "861204",
                "display": "brimonidine tartrate 1 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "308739",
                "display": "bimatoprost 0.3 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              },
              {
                "system": "RxNorm",
                "code": "314072",
                "display": "latanoprost 0.05 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "transition": "High_IOP_Medication_Selection"
        }
      ]
    },
    "High_IOP_Medication_Selection": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "Prostaglandin_Analogs",
          "distribution": 0.3
        },
        {
          "transition": "Beta_Blockers",
          "distribution": 0.25
        },
        {
          "transition": "Carbonic_Anhydrase_Inhibitors",
          "distribution": 0.2
        },
        {
          "transition": "Timolol_Combination",
          "distribution": 0.15
        },
        {
          "transition": "Alpha_Agonists",
          "distribution": 0.1
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prostaglandin_Analogs": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "transition": "Latanoprost",
          "distribution": 0.4
        },
        {
          "transition": "Travoprost",
          "distribution": 0.3
        },
        {
          "transition": "Bimatoprost",
          "distribution": 0.3
        }
      ]
    },
    "Travoprost": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "284008",
          "display": "travoprost 0.04 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Beta_Blockers": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "2702393",
          "display": "timolol hemihydrate 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Carbonic_Anhydrase_Inhibitors": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "310015",
          "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Timolol_Combination": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "1923432",
          "display": "dorzolamide 20 MG/ML / timolol 5 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Alpha_Agonists": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "861204",
          "display": "brimonidine tartrate 1 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Normal_IOP_Follow_Up": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Bimatoprost": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "308739",
          "display": "bimatoprost 0.3 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    },
    "Latanoprost": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "314072",
          "display": "latanoprost 0.05 MG/ML Ophthalmic Solution"
        }
      ],
      "chronic": true,
      "direct_transition": "Terminal"
    }
  },
  "gmf_version": 2
}
